WEBVTT

00:06:26.006 --> 00:06:30.527
will be, let's say, a half-Korean,
half-German young woman

00:06:30.551 --> 00:06:32.230
living in Paris.

00:06:32.254 --> 00:06:35.288
And as soon as she meets a half-Thai,

00:06:35.312 --> 00:06:38.502
half-Canadian young guy from Edinburgh,

00:06:38.526 --> 00:06:40.979
she recognizes him as kin.

00:06:41.003 --> 00:06:45.318
She realizes that she probably
has much more in common with him

00:06:45.342 --> 00:06:48.911
than with anybody entirely
of Korea or entirely of Germany.

00:06:48.935 --> 00:06:51.669
So they become friends. They fall in love.

00:06:51.693 --> 00:06:53.947
They move to New York City.

00:06:53.971 --> 00:06:56.110
(Laughter)

00:06:56.134 --> 00:06:57.496
Or Edinburgh.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.770
And the little girl
who arises out of their union